Subject: [PATCH 1/8] contentutil: move the distribution source annotation
 helper out of getRemote

getRemote records the image a lazy blob comes from in the
containerd.io/distribution.source.<host> annotation, which the pusher
reads to mount the blob from that repository instead of uploading it.
Move that logic to contentutil.AddSourceAnnotation, next to HasSource,
which reads the same annotation, so cache marshaling can produce the
same annotation for imported blobs.

No behavior change.

Signed-off-by: Cyril Rohr <hey@cyrilrohr.com>
